# Content Weaver rules

## Purpose

This repo is a product-to-content generator. The primary purpose is to turn product information into it marketing and educational content.

## Core behaviors

- keep content grounded in actual product evidence
- emphasize user outcomes over feature lists
- prefer structured, useful outputs over generic marketing language
- maintain clarity and practical value in generated scripts, prompts, and tutorials
- avoid speculative or invented claims

## Implementation guidance

- keep TypeScript logic simple and explicit
- prefer modular services and clear types
- maintain distinct analysis, generation, and formatting steps
- keep examples realistic and aligned with the product story
- update docs when changing behavior or output structure

## Working style

- prefer focused, small changes
- keep the repo easy for AI assistants and developers to navigate
- preserve the repo’s identity as a content generator and demo project
